<template>
  <main class="user-setup" aria-label="User Setup Story">
    <header class="setup-top"><span>User Setup</span><button class="usx-btn" :disabled="busy" @click="later">Do this later<UIcon name="close" /></button></header>
    <p v-if="error" class="setup-error" role="alert">{{ error }}</p>
    <p v-if="!loaded">Loading your setup…</p>
    <StoryWizard v-else :steps="steps" :model-value="step" :allow-jump="false" :busy="busy" :next-disabled="!canContinue" finish-label="Start my workspace" @update:model-value="move" @finish="finish">
      <template #step-0><div class="setup-question"><label for="setup-name">Your name</label><input id="setup-name" ref="nameInput" v-model="name" autocomplete="name" maxlength="100" required @keydown.enter.prevent="move(1)" /><label for="setup-email">Email</label><input id="setup-email" v-model="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="160" /><p>These details stay in your local profile. You can change them later.</p></div></template>
      <template #step-1><div class="setup-question"><SetupLocationSelect id="setup-city" v-model="city" label="City or region" autocomplete="address-level2" :options="cityOptions" @select="chooseCity" /><SetupLocationSelect id="setup-country" v-model="country" label="Country" autocomplete="country-name" :options="countries" @select="chooseCountry" /><p>uDOS uses grid-based locations. Your timezone suggests a place once; choose or confirm it to link a local GridCore map cell. No GPS reading is taken.</p><output v-if="gridLocation" class="setup-grid-location">GridCore · {{ seedStatus.maps.find(map=>map.id===gridLocation?.map)?.name }} · column {{ gridLocation.column + 1 }}, row {{ gridLocation.row + 1 }}<small>Place-seed reference, not a precise address.</small></output><p v-else-if="city && country">Choose a listed place to link its map data. Some polar places may be outside the installed map coverage.</p><details class="setup-seeds" :open="!seedsReady" aria-label="Local seed data"><summary>Local seed data · {{ seedsReady ? 'Ready' : 'Needs attention' }}</summary><div><strong>Local seed data</strong><button class="usx-btn" type="button" :disabled="busy" @click="recheckSeeds"><UIcon name="refresh" />Recheck</button></div><ul><li><UIcon :name="seedStatus.knowledge_library ? 'check_circle' : 'error_outline'" />Global Knowledge Library · {{ seedStatus.knowledge_library ? 'Available' : 'Needs installation' }}</li><li><UIcon :name="seedStatus.gridcore_protocols && seedStatus.gridcore_mapping ? 'check_circle' : 'error_outline'" />GridCore protocols · {{ seedStatus.gridcore_protocols && seedStatus.gridcore_mapping ? 'Available' : 'Needs installation' }}</li><li><UIcon :name="seedStatus.maps.length ? 'check_circle' : 'error_outline'" />Map seeds · {{ seedStatus.maps.length ? seedStatus.maps.length+' available' : 'Needs installation' }}</li><li><UIcon :name="locations.length ? 'check_circle' : 'error_outline'" />Place catalogue · {{ locations.length ? locations.length+' places' : 'Needs installation' }}</li></ul><p v-if="!seedsReady">Some local seed data is missing. Complete baseline installation, then recheck. You can pause setup with Do this later.</p><p v-if="seedError" role="alert">{{ seedError }}</p></details></div></template>
      <template #step-2><div class="setup-question"><label for="setup-zone">Device timezone</label><input id="setup-zone" :value="hostZone" readonly /><p>Your device manages the clock and timezone. uCore follows it automatically.</p><label for="setup-locale">Date and time format</label><select id="setup-locale" v-model="locale"><option v-for="option in localeOptions" :key="option.id" :value="option.id">{{ option.name }}</option></select><output>{{ sampleDate }}</output></div></template>
      <template #step-3><div class="setup-question"><label for="setup-theme">Appearance</label><select id="setup-theme" v-model="theme"><option value="auto">Follow my device</option><option value="dark">Dark</option><option value="light">Light</option></select><label for="setup-font">Text size</label><input id="setup-font" v-model.number="fontSize" type="number" min="12" max="24" /><p :style="{fontSize:fontSize+'px'}">Your knowledge, tasks and notes in one calm workspace.</p></div></template>
      <template #step-4><div class="setup-question"><fieldset><legend>Start here when setup finishes</legend><label v-for="option in startOptions" :key="option.id" class="setup-choice"><input type="radio" v-model="startSurface" :value="option.id" /><UIcon :name="option.icon" /><span>{{ option.label }}<small>{{ option.description }}</small></span></label></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Add a starter workflow</legend><label class="setup-choice"><input type="radio" v-model="starterWorkflow" value="" />Start with an empty workspace</label><label v-for="option in starterOptions" :key="option.id" class="setup-choice"><input type="radio" v-model="starterWorkflow" :value="option.id" /><span>{{ option.label }}<small>{{ option.description }}</small></span></label></fieldset><p>Starters create four editable tasks. They do not schedule reminders or run automations.</p><p>Your documents stay in your existing Vault. Connections use only the lists and groups you choose.</p></div></template>
      <template #step-5><div class="setup-question"><p>{{ ollama.online ? 'Ollama is running locally.' : 'Ollama is not available yet. You can install it now or continue without choosing a model.' }}</p><div class="setup-assistant-actions"><a v-if="!ollama.online" class="usx-btn" href="https://ollama.com/download" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Download Ollama<UIcon name="open_in_new" /></a><button class="usx-btn" :disabled="checkingOllama" @click="checkOllama"><UIcon name="refresh" />{{ checkingOllama ? 'Checking…' : 'Check Ollama' }}</button><a v-if="ollama.online&&!ollama.models.length" class="usx-btn" href="https://ollama.com/library" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Find a local model<UIcon name="open_in_new" /></a></div><label for="setup-model">Default model</label><select id="setup-model" v-model="defaultModel"><option value="auto">Choose later</option><option v-for="model in ollama.models" :key="model.name" :value="model.name">{{ model.name }}{{ model.size_gb ? ' · '+model.size_gb+' GB' : '' }}</option></select><p>Only installed local models are listed. Setup does not download models or send an AI request.</p></div></template>
      <template #step-6><div class="setup-question"><dl class="setup-review"><dt>Name</dt><dd>{{ name }}</dd><dt>Email</dt><dd>{{ email || 'Not set' }}</dd><dt>Location</dt><dd>{{ [city,country].filter(Boolean).join(', ') || 'Not set' }}</dd><dt>Grid location</dt><dd>{{ gridLocation ? `${gridLocation.map} · ${gridLocation.column+1}, ${gridLocation.row+1}` : 'No installed map coverage' }}</dd><dt>Timezone</dt><dd>{{ hostZone }} · follows device</dd><dt>Date format</dt><dd>{{ locale }}</dd><dt>Appearance</dt><dd>{{ theme }} · {{ fontSize }}px</dd><dt>Starter</dt><dd>{{ starterOptions.find(option=>option.id===starterWorkflow)?.label || 'Empty workspace' }}</dd><dt>Local model</dt><dd>{{ defaultModel==='auto' ? 'Choose later' : defaultModel }}</dd><dt>Start with</dt><dd>{{ startOptions.find(option=>option.id===startSurface)?.label }}</dd></dl><p>Your profile stays local. Configure app connections later in Settings → Apps. Snackbar coordinates their sync.</p></div></template>
      <template #footer-center><span class="setup-save-note">{{ busy ? 'Saving…' : 'Progress is saved when you continue' }}</span></template>
    </StoryWizard>
  </main>
</template>
<script setup lang="ts">
import { computed, nextTick, onMounted, ref, watch } from 'vue';
import { useRouter } from 'vue-router';
import StoryWizard from '../../skills/organisms/StoryWizard.vue';
import SetupLocationSelect from './SetupLocationSelect.vue';
import { latToRow, lonToCol, type LayerMap } from '@udos/gridcore/seeds/layer-map';
import UIcon from '../../skills/atoms/UIcon.vue';
import { useIdentityStore } from '../../stores/identity';
import { useSettingsStore } from '../../stores/settings';
import { UCORE_BASE } from '../../api/base';
const router=useRouter(), identity=useIdentityStore(), preferences=useSettingsStore();
const step=ref(0), loaded=ref(false), busy=ref(false), error=ref(''), nameInput=ref<HTMLInputElement|null>(null);
const email=ref(''),defaultModel=ref('auto'),ollama=ref<{online:boolean;models:{name:string;size_gb?:number}[]}>({online:false,models:[]}),checkingOllama=ref(false);
const name=ref(''),city=ref(''),country=ref(''),locale=ref(navigator.language||'en-AU');
type Location = {city:string;country:string;timezone:string;country_code?:string;point?:{latitude:number;longitude:number}};
type MapSeed = Pick<LayerMap,'name'|'format'|'projection'|'bounds'|'cols'|'rows'> & {id:string};
const seedStatus=ref<{knowledge_library:boolean;gridcore_protocols:boolean;gridcore_mapping:boolean;maps:MapSeed[]}>({knowledge_library:false,gridcore_protocols:false,gridcore_mapping:false,maps:[]});
const seedError=ref('');
const seedsReady=computed(()=>locations.value.length>0 && seedStatus.value.knowledge_library && seedStatus.value.gridcore_protocols && seedStatus.value.gridcore_mapping && seedStatus.value.maps.some(map=>map.id==='world-map'));
const selectedPlace=computed(()=>locations.value.find(row=>row.city.toLowerCase()===city.value.trim().toLowerCase()&&row.country.toLowerCase()===country.value.trim().toLowerCase()));
const gridLocation=computed(()=>{const point=selectedPlace.value?.point;if(!point)return null;const map=seedStatus.value.maps.filter(map=>point.latitude>=map.bounds.latMin&&point.latitude<map.bounds.latMax&&point.longitude>=map.bounds.lonMin&&point.longitude<map.bounds.lonMax).sort((a,b)=>(a.bounds.latMax-a.bounds.latMin)*(a.bounds.lonMax-a.bounds.lonMin)-(b.bounds.latMax-b.bounds.latMin)*(b.bounds.lonMax-b.bounds.lonMin))[0];if(!map)return null;return {map:map.id,column:lonToCol({...map,layers:[]},point.longitude),row:latToRow({...map,layers:[]},point.latitude)};});
const locations=ref<Location[]>([]),countries=ref<string[]>([]),locationSeeded=ref(false);
const cityOptions=computed(()=>[...new Set(locations.value.filter(row=>!country.value || row.country.toLowerCase()===country.value.trim().toLowerCase()).map(row=>row.city))].sort());
function chooseCity(value:string){const row=locations.value.find(row=>row.city===value&&(!country.value||row.country===country.value));if(row)country.value=row.country;}
function chooseCountry(value:string){if(city.value&&!locations.value.some(row=>row.city===city.value&&row.country===value))city.value='';}
const hostZone=Intl.DateTimeFormat().resolvedOptions().timeZone;
const starterWorkflow=ref('');
const starterOptions=[{id:'daily',label:'A calmer day',description:'Check in, choose one priority, take a break and reflect.'},{id:'focus',label:'A focused session',description:'Make a small plan, do one useful step and save your progress.'},{id:'learning',label:'Learn something useful',description:'Explore a question, practise and keep what you learn.'}];
const theme=ref<'auto'|'dark'|'light'>('auto'),fontSize=ref(16),startSurface=ref('workflow');
const steps=[{title:'What should we call you?',subtitle:'Let’s make this workspace yours.'},{title:'Where are you based?',subtitle:'Start with your device timezone, then choose your location.'},{title:'Make time feel familiar',subtitle:'Your device remains the clock authority.'},{title:'Make it comfortable',subtitle:'Choose a clear, readable display.'},{title:'What would you like to do first?',subtitle:'Everything else stays one tab away.'},{title:'Your local assistant',subtitle:'Use Ollama on this device, or choose a model later.'},{title:'Ready to begin?',subtitle:'Review your choices before saving your profile.'}];
const localeOptions=computed(()=>[...new Map([{id:navigator.language||'en-AU',name:'Device format ('+(navigator.language||'en-AU')+')'},{id:'en-AU',name:'English · Australia'},{id:'en-GB',name:'English · United Kingdom'},{id:'en-US',name:'English · United States'},{id:'de-DE',name:'Deutsch'},{id:'fr-FR',name:'Français'},{id:'es-ES',name:'Español'}].map(option=>[option.id,option])).values()]);
const sampleDate=computed(()=>{try{return new Intl.DateTimeFormat(locale.value,{dateStyle:'full',timeStyle:'short'}).format(new Date());}catch{return new Intl.DateTimeFormat(undefined,{dateStyle:'full',timeStyle:'short'}).format(new Date());}});
const startOptions=[{id:'workflow',label:'My daily workflow',icon:'checklist',description:'Tasks, contacts, notes and monitored feeds'},{id:'knowledge',label:'My knowledge library',icon:'auto_stories',description:'Read and curate local knowledge'},{id:'ucode',label:'uCode',icon:'terminal',description:'Simple commands and learning'},{id:'research',label:'Research',icon:'travel_explore',description:'Collect findings and connect them to work'}];
const startPaths:Record<string,string>={workflow:'/workflow',knowledge:'/documentation?tab=wiki',ucode:'/ucode',research:'/workflow?tab=research'};
const canContinue=computed(()=>!!name.value.trim() && fontSize.value>=12 && fontSize.value<=24 && !!hostZone && ((step.value!==1 && step.value!==6) || (!!city.value.trim() && !!country.value.trim() && seedsReady.value && !!selectedPlace.value)));
function answers(){return {starter_workflow:starterWorkflow.value,email:email.value,default_model:defaultModel.value,location_timezone:selectedPlace.value?.timezone||'',country_code:selectedPlace.value?.country_code||'',grid_location:gridLocation.value,location_seeded:String(locationSeeded.value),city:city.value,country:country.value,locale:locale.value,host_timezone:hostZone,start_surface:startSurface.value,theme_mode:theme.value,font_size:String(fontSize.value)};}
async function request(path:string,body?:any){const response=await fetch(`${UCORE_BASE}/api/connections${path}`,{method:body===undefined?'GET':'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},...(body===undefined?{}:{body:JSON.stringify(body)})});if(!response.ok)throw Error((await response.text()).slice(0,240));return response.json();}
async function save(next:number,completed=false,deferred=false){await request('/setup',{display_name:name.value,answers:answers(),step:next,completed,deferred});}
async function focusQuestion(){await nextTick();document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.user-setup .story-wizard__slide input:not([readonly]),.user-setup .story-wizard__slide select')?.focus();}
async function move(next:number){if(busy.value || (next>step.value&&!canContinue.value))return;busy.value=true;error.value='';try{await save(next);step.value=next;await focusQuestion();}catch(exc){error.value=exc instanceof Error?exc.message:'Setup could not be saved';}finally{busy.value=false;}}
async function later(){if(busy.value)return;busy.value=true;try{await save(step.value,false,true);await router.push('/');}catch(exc){error.value=exc instanceof Error?exc.message:'Setup could not be paused';}finally{busy.value=false;}}
async function finish(){if(!canContinue.value||busy.value)return;busy.value=true;error.value='';try{preferences.setThemeMode(theme.value);preferences.setFontSize(fontSize.value);preferences.setDefaultModel(defaultModel.value);await preferences.save();if(preferences.syncError)throw Error(preferences.syncError);await save(6,true);await identity.load();await router.replace(startPaths[startSurface.value]||'/workflow');}catch(exc){error.value=exc instanceof Error?exc.message:'Setup could not be completed';}finally{busy.value=false;}}
async function checkOllama(){checkingOllama.value=true;try{const response=await fetch(`${UCORE_BASE}/api/ollama/status`,{signal:AbortSignal.timeout(6000)});if(!response.ok)throw Error();const data=await response.json();ollama.value={online:!!data.online,models:Array.isArray(data.models)?data.models:[]};}catch{ollama.value={online:false,models:[]};}finally{checkingOllama.value=false;}}
watch(step,(value)=>{if(value===5)void checkOllama();});
function applyCatalog(catalog:any){locations.value=catalog.locations||[];countries.value=catalog.countries||[];if(catalog.readiness)seedStatus.value=catalog.readiness;seedError.value=catalog.source?'':'Location seed data could not be checked.';}
async function recheckSeeds(){busy.value=true;try{applyCatalog(await request('/setup/locations?timezone='+encodeURIComponent(hostZone)));}catch{seedError.value='Seed data could not be checked. Try again.';}finally{busy.value=false;}}
onMounted(async()=>{
  try {
    await identity.load();
    const [state,catalog]=await Promise.all([request(''),request('/setup/locations?timezone='+encodeURIComponent(hostZone)).catch(()=>({locations:[],countries:[],suggestion:null}))]);
    applyCatalog(catalog);
    const responses=state.setup_story?.responses||{},profile=state.user_profile||{};
    starterWorkflow.value=responses.starter_workflow||'';
    email.value=responses.email||profile.email||'';defaultModel.value=responses.default_model||preferences.defaultModel||'auto';
    name.value=responses.display_name||state.setup.display_name||identity.displayName;
    city.value=responses.city ?? profile.city ?? '';
    country.value=responses.country ?? profile.country ?? '';
    locale.value=responses.locale||profile.locale||navigator.language||'en-AU';
    theme.value=responses.theme_mode||preferences.themeMode;
    fontSize.value=Number(responses.font_size||preferences.fontSize);
    startSurface.value=responses.start_surface||profile.start_surface||'workflow';
    step.value=Math.min(6,Math.max(0,Number(state.setup.step||0)));
    locationSeeded.value=responses.location_seeded==='true';
    // Saved nonempty answers win; the marker also protects intentional clearing.
    if(catalog.source && !locationSeeded.value && !state.setup.completed && !city.value.trim() && !country.value.trim()){
      if(catalog.suggestion){city.value=catalog.suggestion.city;country.value=catalog.suggestion.country;}
      locationSeeded.value=true;
      await save(step.value);
    }
    loaded.value=true;if(step.value===5)void checkOllama();await focusQuestion();
  }catch(exc){error.value=exc instanceof Error?exc.message:'Setup is unavailable';}
});
</script>
<style scoped>
.user-setup { height:100dvh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;box-sizing:border-box;background:var(--usx-color-background);color:var(--usx-color-on-surface);font-family:var(--usx-font-family-sans); }
.setup-top {display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:8px 16px;flex-shrink:0;font-size:var(--usx-font-size-sm);}.setup-top .usx-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;min-height:32px;margin:0;padding:0 8px;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;}.setup-top :deep(.u-icon){font-size:20px;}
.user-setup :deep(.story-wizard){width:min(100%,68rem);margin-inline:auto;min-height:0;flex:1;}.user-setup :deep(.story-wizard__header){border:0;padding:24px 24px 8px;}.user-setup :deep(.story-wizard__title){font-size:clamp(1.6rem,4vw,2.5rem);line-height:1.25;}.user-setup :deep(.story-wizard__dots){padding:8px 24px;margin:0;}.user-setup :deep(.story-wizard__stage){min-height:0;flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:16px 24px;}.user-setup :deep(.story-wizard__slide){position:relative;inset:auto;min-height:0;padding:0;margin:0;}.user-setup :deep(.story-wizard__nav){flex-shrink:0;padding:12px 24px;border-top:1px solid var(--usx-color-border);}.setup-assistant-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;}.setup-assistant-actions .usx-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;min-height:32px;margin:0;padding:4px 8px;}.setup-grid-location{font-size:var(--usx-font-size-sm);padding:10px;border:1px solid var(--usx-color-border);border-radius:var(--usx-radius-sm);}.setup-grid-location small{display:block;color:var(--usx-color-on-surface-muted)}.setup-seeds{font-size:var(--usx-font-size-sm);border-top:1px solid var(--usx-color-border);padding-top:12px;}.setup-seeds summary{cursor:pointer;margin-bottom:8px;}.setup-seeds>div{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;}.setup-seeds ul{list-style:none;margin:8px 0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:6px;}.setup-seeds li{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;}.setup-seeds .usx-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;min-height:28px;padding:0 6px;margin:0;border:0;box-shadow:none;}.setup-question{display:grid;gap:12px;width:min(100%,40rem);margin:0 auto;}.setup-question label{margin:0;font-size:var(--usx-font-size-base);}.setup-question p,.setup-accounts>p{color:var(--usx-color-on-surface-muted);font-size:var(--usx-font-size-sm);line-height:1.6;margin:0;}.setup-question input:not([type=radio]),.setup-question select{box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:44px;min-height:44px;padding:8px 12px;margin:0;border:1px solid var(--usx-color-border);border-radius:var(--usx-radius-sm);background:var(--usx-color-surface);color:inherit;font:inherit;box-shadow:none;outline:0;}.setup-question input:focus-visible,.setup-question select:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--usx-color-primary);outline-offset:-2px;border-color:transparent;}.setup-question fieldset{display:grid;gap:8px;padding:0;border:0;margin:0;}.setup-choice{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px;border:1px solid var(--usx-color-border);border-radius:var(--usx-radius-sm);}.setup-choice small{display:block;color:var(--usx-color-on-surface-muted);font-size:var(--usx-font-size-sm);}.setup-choice input{margin:0;}.setup-review{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr);gap:10px;margin:0;}.setup-review dd{margin:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere;}.setup-review dt{color:var(--usx-color-on-surface-muted);}.setup-save-note{font-size:var(--usx-font-size-xs);color:var(--usx-color-on-surface-muted);}.setup-error{margin:8px 24px;color:var(--usx-color-danger);}.setup-accounts :deep(.connections){padding:12px 0;}.setup-accounts{width:100%;}
@media(max-width:40rem){.setup-save-note{display:none;}.user-setup :deep(.story-wizard__header),.user-setup :deep(.story-wizard__stage){padding-inline:16px;}.user-setup :deep(.story-wizard__nav){padding:8px 16px;}}
</style>
